        },
        "text_AHtUHA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>The pinnacle of Silverado suspension engineering.</em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Increase:</strong> 4250kg.</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> <strong>Fox 3.0 Internal Bypass Race Series Shocks</strong> (front and rear).</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> The enthusiast who wants it all—maximum legal payload combined with race-bred suspension technology.</li><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> The 3.0 Bypass shocks offer unparalleled heat dissipation and damping control. It’s the ultimate \"go-anywhere\" setup that remains legally compliant across Australia.</li><li><strong>Part Number 200kg Leaf Pack: </strong>CHV-1500-Stage5-GVM-200</li><li><strong>Part Number 400kg Leaf Pack: </strong>CHV-1500-Stage5-GVM-400</li></ul><p><em><strong>Note: Chevy Silverado ZR2 has reduced GCM due to the 4.2T towing capacity.</strong></em><br/><br/></p>"
